{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ちっさい団子／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は収録とリハだったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかライブいっぱい楽しみ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都の全握まりっかレーンに\n行くか迷ってるんですけど\nどーすればいいですかぁ？？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれないとすねる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"迷ったらあすかまりかレーン←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかのＰＶの曲発売の\n予定はないの？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...それがね！\n実は......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないんだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おしるこには白玉派？お餅派？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわうわうわー迷うやつ！\nそれは...えっ、どうしよう。\nお餅で！餅すき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかの家でクリスマスに必ず\n食べるものはある？...ケーキ以外で！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケーキ以外ね...\n............肉。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこの古着屋に行くんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フラミンゴとサンタモニカ\nすきです。\n高円寺もいっぱいあって楽しいよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなロケしてみたい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海外ロケ！どこでも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年、初詣に行く？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行くよ^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カラオケ十八番はありますかー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"椎名林檎さんの\nカーネーション。\n相対性理論さんも歌うよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダッフィー\n何体くらい持ってますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ってません...！\n女の子は持ってるもんなのかな?\nたしかによく見かけるけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかの神曲は、何？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部すきだけど\nなみころ、音が出ないギター\n毎日聴いてる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、1番作りたい料理は？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とん汁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年末年始の特番でこれは絶対見る！\nっていうのはある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガキ使の罰ゲームは\n毎年録画してるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。お笑い見たい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リクエストいっぱい\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふはは\nとりあえず締め切ります。\nものっそいリクエスト\nいっぱいきたので！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント読んでるうちに\nなんか難易度上がってきてた気が笑\nなんじゃそれみたいなのとか\nあーその発想おもしろい！\nみたいなのとか...\n楽しく読ませていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとずつだけどリクエストの\n写真撮ったら載っけるね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではさっそくいくよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その1あすかと2ショット"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(うしろにせいたん)\nあすかの顔ワッてやりたくなる。\nワッて。...わかる？←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都全握のレーンあすかと一緒♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅりんふぁむのみなさん\nよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっ会のみなさんもよろしくね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はレコチョクライブ♪\n頑張る！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}